On Friday, October 23, at 10.00, the press center of the Interfax-Ukraine news agency (8/5a Reitarska Street) will host a discussion entitled "Ukraine on the threshold of winter: Energy, defense and new diplomatic reality."

Participants include
Director of the Energy Industry Research Center Oleksandr Kharchenko;
President of the International Institute for Security Studies Oleksiy Buryachenko;
military-political observer Denys Popovych;
political analyst, Head of the Center for Analysis and Strategies Ihor Chalenko.

The event will be streamed on the Interfax-Ukraine YouTube channel. Admission requires registration on the spot with press ID cards.

